      "text": "New: pages that appear only after something goes wrong or is empty. Every error says what is wrong and how to fix it, in words. Builder states, left to right: chosen, sold out, expires before the delivery date, would exceed the budget (budget is a hard cap, as in the builder). Bracketed values ([30 phút], [PHÍ], [TỔNG], support contact) are facts the team must set.",
